[PrintTextModified Text:夏目安安承认了<br>杀害佐伯米莉亚的罪行——|#0102Adv27_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，这场魔女审判中，<br>所有少女全都一致把票投给了安安。|#0102Adv27_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她那恐怖的魔法和死气沉沉的眼神<br>让少女们害怕得颤抖不已。|#0102Adv27_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2.2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:52,28 AppearanceAndTransition:14_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,55 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms- SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:快、快点处刑她！<br>谁知道她会对我们做什么！|#0102Adv27_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冷静点。她的魔法只是【轻度洗脑】。<br>只要意志坚定就不会被蛊惑。|#0102Adv27_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，安安想杀的是米莉亚。<br>|#0102Adv27_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她对我们并没有杀意。<br>对吧？|#0102Adv27_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安默不作声地点点头。<br>现场的气氛一下子缓和了起来。|#0102Adv27_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（大家变得有些不太对劲啊。<br>　马上就要处刑安安了，<br>　为什么反而松了口气呢……）|#0102Adv27_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:上次处刑的惨状<br>让在场所有人都被吓得面无血色。|#0102Adv27_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但即便如此，<br>安安看起来依旧非常镇静。|#0102Adv27_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

