[PrintTextModified Text:哇……这可太华丽了！|#0102Adv27_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是要上演人偶剧吗？|#0102Adv27_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:处刑台上，矗立着一座人偶剧风格的<br>巨大舞台装置。|#0102Adv27_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:精致装点的华丽布景之上，<br>挂着鲜红的幕帘。|#0102Adv27_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安被看守<br>押送至处刑台。|#0102Adv27_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

