[PrintTextModified Text:她侧眼瞥了一眼艾玛。|#0102Adv27_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么……？<br>吾辈可是把你当作朋友看待的。|#0102Adv27_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（什么……？）|#0102Adv27_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原以为我们终于可以回到当初了。|#0102Adv27_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那哀伤的眼神，仿佛在倾诉发自内心的痛苦。|#0102Adv27_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（为什么看着我……？<br>　安安和我，<br>　应该还没要好到那个地步，才对……）|#0102Adv27_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们不是约好了<br>再一起看电影吗。|#0102Adv27_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

