[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0102Adv27_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真相在艾玛的脑海里翻涌而上。|#0102Adv27_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那过于残酷的真相<br>狠狠剜开了她的心。|#0102Adv27_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随后，安安被带到人偶剧的舞台上。|#0102Adv27_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 高速で糸が巻きつく音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_56 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:420_1

[PrintTextModified Text:垂下的丝线<br>迅速缠绕在安安的身上。|#0102Adv27_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀呀，真是讽刺。<br>操纵别人的你也有被当作人偶操纵的那一天。|#0102Adv27_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你操纵大家杀死了大叔，<br>这是理所当然的报应啊。|#0102Adv27_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么要杀了大叔！为什么！|#0102Adv27_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不是米莉亚……|#0102Adv27_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的低语<br>引来了众人的注视。|#0102Adv27_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安你想杀的人<br>是我吧……|#0102Adv27_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:421_1

[PrintTextModified Text:？你在说什么？<br>你不是佐伯米莉亚的灵魂吗……？|#0102Adv27_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那时，你不是说过吗。<br>你们交换了……身体……|#0102Adv27_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills Loop:false
