@Wait WaitMode:2.4

[PrintTextModified Text:她嘟哝了一会，<br>忽然惊愕地睁大双眼。|#0102Adv27_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她也明白了这个真相。|#0102Adv27_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

