[PrintTextModified Text:啊、啊啊、啊——！|#0102Adv27_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来，那时米莉亚<br>骗了吾辈吗——！|#0102Adv27_AnAn007| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

