@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Miria-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:25 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚被五花大绑在里面，<br>折磨得精疲力竭。|#0102Adv27_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……对不起，<br>吾辈不该撒娇，拜托你弄坏热气球。|#0102Adv27_AnAn008| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:由于无法通过素描本交流，<br>安安只好开口说话。|#0102Adv27_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来，是吾辈的【洗脑】魔法<br>发动了……|#0102Adv27_AnAn009| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚无力地笑了笑。|#0102Adv27_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我多少也感觉到了……<br>大概是因为你对我说想弄坏热气球，<br>我才产生了那样的想法。|#0102Adv27_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这并不是你的错啦。<br>实际去做的人是大叔我啊。|#0102Adv27_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，大叔我也……|#0102Adv27_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:——都是那家伙的错！|#0102Adv27_AnAn010| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你是指……？|#0102Adv27_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……樱羽艾玛。|#0102Adv27_AnAn011| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安的眼里含着几分阴郁的杀意。|#0102Adv27_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:都怪她一直喊着要出去要出去！<br>大家才转变了主意！|#0102Adv27_AnAn012| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她总是要给吾辈添堵！<br>蕾雅的死也是，都怪她大吵大闹蕾雅是凶手，<br>就是她害死了蕾雅！|#0102Adv27_AnAn013| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅是多么善良的一个人！|#0102Adv27_AnAn014| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，冷静点……|#0102Adv27_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈准备杀死她。|#0102Adv27_AnAn015| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这句话，<br>米莉亚渐渐睁大了眼。|#0102Adv27_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0102Adv27_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:计划已经制定好了。吾辈不会再容忍她。<br>不杀了她我咽不下这口气。|#0102Adv27_AnAn016| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，这……|#0102Adv27_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对吾辈而言轻而易举！<br>只要能【洗脑】某人，<br>就可以不留下一丝痕迹地杀害她！|#0102Adv27_AnAn017| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要她去死的话！只要她去死！<br>去死……！|#0102Adv27_AnAn018| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv27_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚低下头，而后又抬起头说。|#0102Adv27_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:……噗，啊哈哈！你真是太可笑了安安！|#0102Adv27_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚……？你怎么了……？|#0102Adv27_AnAn019| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的计划已经失败了。<br>因为，我就是【樱羽艾玛】啊。|#0102Adv27_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Surprised1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:……樱羽艾玛……！？|#0102Adv27_AnAn020| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:你也知道吧？<br>佐伯米莉亚的魔法是【互换】。<br>被看守抓走的时候，她用了这个魔法。|#0102Adv27_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在这具身体里装的是樱羽艾玛的灵魂。<br>而樱羽艾玛的身体里装的是——|#0102Adv27_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔的灵魂。<br>所以，你就算杀了她也毫无意义。|#0102Adv27_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你那么恨我，那你得杀了我啊。|#0102Adv27_Miria014| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了。被看守抓走的时候，<br>我马上把钥匙藏在嘴里了。|#0102Adv27_Miria015| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:反正我不需要这玩意，就吞了它吧。|#0102Adv27_Miria016| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚的喉咙响起吞咽声。|#0102Adv27_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆衝撃で息を呑む

