[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0102Adv27_AnAn021| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:樱羽、艾玛……！|#0102Adv27_AnAn022| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安惊愕得浑身发抖……<br>接着，她用满含憎恶的眼神，看向眼前的少女。|#0102Adv27_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

