[PrintTextModified Text:怎么、怎么会这样！！|#0102Adv27_AnAn023| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不对！吾辈想杀的<br>不是米莉亚！是艾玛！|#0102Adv27_AnAn024| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她可是吞了收纳柜的钥匙！<br>毁掉了我们珍贵的回忆！|#0102Adv27_AnAn025| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills Loop:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,35 Scale:3 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,-15 AppearanceAndTransition:421_3 SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:35 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:1.5
@Wait WaitMode:2.4

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈无法原谅她！！<br>哪怕剖开她的肚子，吾辈也要把<br>钥匙拿出来！！|#0102Adv27_AnAn026| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难道你就是为了这个才捅了她的肚子……|#0102Adv27_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:结果……樱羽艾玛还活着，<br>那岂不是没有任何意义！！|#0102Adv27_AnAn027| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:悲痛的吼叫<br>深深剜开艾玛的心。|#0102Adv27_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来，<br>米莉亚保护了我……|#0102Adv27_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:热气球被破坏的那次，艾玛没有坚信米莉亚，<br>没能维护她。|#0102Adv27_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而——<br>她却保护了艾玛免受憎恨的戕害。|#0102Adv27_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这、这实在是太残酷了……<br>　我究竟该怎样赎罪才好……？）|#0102Adv27_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛心痛得不能自已，<br>眼泪止不住地往外流。|#0102Adv27_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是为什么？<br>安安你为什么想杀我……|#0102Adv27_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,35 Scale:3 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,-15 AppearanceAndTransition:421_4 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想听，不想听，<br>不想听……！|#0102Adv27_AnAn028| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你不准再说话。去死吧。<br>去死，去死，你去死吧！！|#0102Adv27_AnAn029| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,35 Scale:3 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,-15 AppearanceAndTransition:421_4 SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:15 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:安安每下一句诅咒，她的指甲就变得愈发尖长，<br>脸上生出一道道裂痕。<br>那恶毒的外表，正是成为魔女的证明。|#0102Adv27_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的心近乎崩溃。|#0102Adv27_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果死的是我该有多好。<br>　如果死的是不受待见的我就好了）|#0102Adv27_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安小姐……不要，再说下去了……|#0102Adv27_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你可不要胡思乱想。<br>犯下杀人罪的魔女是安安。|#0102Adv27_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。艾玛你没有任何错！|#0102Adv27_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，你这么做可有点不像话吧？<br>事到如今才在这里大喊大叫杀错人了。|#0102Adv27_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,35 Scale:3 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:15,-15 AppearanceAndTransition:421_5 SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:35 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:1.5
@Wait WaitMode:2.4

[PrintTextModified Text:闭嘴！闭嘴闭嘴闭嘴闭嘴……|#0102Adv27_AnAn030| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毫无说服力。谁要听你的命令。|#0102Adv27_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请告诉我，我也很好奇，<br>为什么你想杀害艾玛？|#0102Adv27_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算知道你想杀的是艾玛，<br>我也实在想不通你的动机。|#0102Adv27_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，究竟是为什么！？<br>为了让大家逃出这里，<br>艾玛比任何人都要努力不是吗！|#0102Adv27_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:421_6 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:……吾辈不想出去！|#0102Adv27_AnAn031| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈不想离开这里！|#0102Adv27_AnAn032| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不想……离开这里……？<br>为什么……你不想离开这种鬼地方……！|#0102Adv27_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——吾辈是不可以得到满足的那种人。<br>环境恶劣的监牢<br>对吾辈来说反而是理想的居所。|#0102Adv27_AnAn033| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈想永远生活在这里。<br>而且……|#0102Adv27_AnAn034| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:来这里以前，从来没有人陪在吾辈的身边。<br>但在这里，第一次有人愿意陪着我。|#0102Adv27_AnAn035| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算不说话，<br>也有人愿意做我的朋友……！|#0102Adv27_AnAn036| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对吾辈而言，这里的生活<br>变得更加美好了！|#0102Adv27_AnAn037| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是吗……原来是这样）|#0102Adv27_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安平时看着艾玛的时候，<br>眼里总是带着一丝冷漠。|#0102Adv27_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在越狱计划的推动下，少女们团结一心，<br>而艾玛一直是团队的中心。|#0102Adv27_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对于【不想离开这里的少女】而言，<br>樱羽艾玛只是个妨碍者。|#0102Adv27_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪怕毁坏了为越狱准备的热气球，<br>艾玛仍旧没有放弃，<br>这导致安安对她的憎恶越来越深。|#0102Adv27_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安恨她恨得一拳又一拳地捶打地面，<br>打到没力气动弹。|#0102Adv27_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，我听不懂你在说什么，<br>能老老实实地接受处刑吗？|#0102Adv27_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你是犯下杀人罪的魔女这点<br>可是事实。|#0102Adv27_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真是烦死人了。<br>喂典狱长！要处刑就快点动手啊！|#0102Adv27_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要！吾辈想杀的是樱羽艾玛！！<br>不要处刑我！！|#0102Adv27_AnAn038| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会是米莉亚替她死掉，骗人！！|#0102Adv27_AnAn039| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——噗的一下，<br>玛格笑出了声。|#0102Adv27_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

