[PrintTextModified Text:刚才还在看守的束缚下<br>拼命挣扎惊慌失措的安安，现在突然静止不动了。|#0102Adv27_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她一脸茫然若失的表情。|#0102Adv27_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛她们<br>触碰了夏目安安的禁忌。|#0102Adv27_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是她锁在内心深层的<br>不可触及之处。|#0102Adv27_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……<br>原来，吾辈很幸福啊。|#0102Adv27_AnAn041| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了满足自己，吾辈又做了错事——|#0102Adv27_AnAn042| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

