[PrintTextModified Text:安安的父母原本很宠溺她。|#0102Adv27_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安从小体弱多病、性格内向，<br>父母对她可以说有求必应。|#0102Adv27_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:给我买多多的玩具。<br>给我买游戏。|#0102Adv27_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:买蛋糕。<br>买这个房子。|#0102Adv27_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多买点。<br>我想要更多，更多。|#0102Adv27_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:3 Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,80 AppearanceAndTransition:190_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:0 ScenePositionY:80 Scale:2 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:15

[PrintTextModified Text:那只是一个小女孩<br>理所当然的愿望、理所当然的撒娇。|#0102Adv27_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知不觉中，安安发现了。|#0102Adv27_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她所有的要求<br>爸爸妈妈全都会听。|#0102Adv27_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些撩拨耳畔的悄悄话<br>如同甜美的点心一般。|#0102Adv27_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:把我当作公主一样宠爱。<br>绝对不准责骂我。|#0102Adv27_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:永远耐心地陪在我身边。<br>不要睡去，要陪着我。|#0102Adv27_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:陪着我。<br>永远，永远陪着我。|#0102Adv27_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安继续说着甜蜜的低语。|#0102Adv27_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:渐渐地，<br>安安的父母注意到了她那奇妙的魔法。|#0102Adv27_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:2 Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:0,80 AppearanceAndTransition:190_1 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Front Loop:false ScenePositionX:10 ScenePositionY:15 Scale:2 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:8

[PrintTextModified Text:再这样下去，<br>他们就会变成提线木偶。|#0102Adv27_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:变成内心崩坏，<br>丧失灵魂的废人。|#0102Adv27_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了杜绝这样的后果，<br>父亲保护母亲，母亲保护父亲。|#0102Adv27_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:爸爸说，要撒娇只准找爸爸。<br>妈妈说，要撒娇只准找妈妈。|#0102Adv27_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样，在他们都没有意识到，<br>甚至安安自己也没有意识到的一天天里。|#0102Adv27_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:作为幸福的代价，她终究亲手摧毁了自己的父母——|#0102Adv27_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:190_1
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle,Stills-Front Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她无法再祈愿幸福了。|#0102Adv27_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在那以后安安一直躲在家里，<br>和人偶父母生活在一起。|#0102Adv27_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.6 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:背上魔女的罪名被逮捕进监狱以后，<br>这群少女成了她第一次交到的朋友。|#0102Adv27_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她想和这些女孩<br>永远在一起。|#0102Adv27_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一旦离开这里，<br>就要回到与坏掉的人偶相伴的生活。|#0102Adv27_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她好不容易得到了渴望已久的生活。<br>然而此时却出现了一名碍事者。|#0102Adv27_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

