[PrintTextModified Text:一滴泪，从安安的眼角滑落。<br>那是饱含悔意的泪。|#0102Adv27_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚、蕾雅、米莉亚和梅露露，<br>吾辈很喜欢和你们在一起的时光。|#0102Adv27_AnAn043| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，吾辈却亲手毁了它。<br>吾辈总是，对幸福发现得太晚。|#0102Adv27_AnAn044| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,10 Scale:2.5 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false ScenePosition:38,10 AppearanceAndTransition:421_9 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:化作提线木偶的安安<br>发现自己的手里不知何时多了一把锋利的刀。|#0102Adv27_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，吾辈不该奢求幸福——|#0102Adv27_AnAn045| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:2 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:420_2 SubId:Forefront

; 切り裂かれる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_53 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她用刀一把刺向自己，而赤蝶亦随之飞舞。<br>悲痛欲绝的惨叫回荡在整个大厅。|#0102Adv27_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Forefront Loop:false ScenePositionX:50 ScenePositionY:50 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:20

[PrintTextModified Text:精美亮堂的盒子里上演了一出<br>与之毫不相称的凄惨人偶剧。|#0102Adv27_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格恍然回过神来，<br>开口说道。|#0102Adv27_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以防万一，大家最好捂住耳朵。<br>她的魔女化程度好像越来越深了。|#0102Adv27_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女化程度越深，魔法能力就会越强。<br>就她而言，<br>想必她的洗脑强制力会变强。|#0102Adv27_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到玛格的话，<br>少女们纷纷慌忙捂住耳朵。|#0102Adv27_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，唯独艾玛一人<br>没有捂住耳朵，站在原地。|#0102Adv27_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喂樱羽！快捂住耳朵啊！<br>你可是最危险的！|#0102Adv27_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊！<br>说不定她会命令谁去杀你……|#0102Adv27_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摇了摇头。|#0102Adv27_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安她<br>不会再做那种事了。|#0102Adv27_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我很震惊，她竟然如此憎恨我……<br>　可是……）|#0102Adv27_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（最理解她想法的人，<br>　一定是我）|#0102Adv27_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛曾经被孤立过，<br>后来连学校都不敢去。|#0102Adv27_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这座监狱里，她结识了一众可以称得上朋友和伙伴的少女。<br>这让她得到了些许救赎。|#0102Adv27_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（对不起，安安。<br>　我夺走了你的一切……）|#0102Adv27_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安尖叫着，<br>不断地复活与再生。|#0102Adv27_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到最后，玛格也松开了捂着耳朵的手。|#0102Adv27_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:420_4 SubId:Forefront

[PrintTextModified Text:鲜红的幕帘渐渐合拢，<br>将异形的怪物——化作【残骸】的安安<br>隐藏在幕后。|#0102Adv27_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是最后一幕，<br>接下来她会被关进永恒的囚牢之中。|#0102Adv27_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 歯車がまわる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_36 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:机关开始运作，<br>将处刑台的底座替换走。|#0102Adv27_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

